.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sqop-encrypt 1 "February 2025" "sqop 0.38.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sqop\-encrypt \- Encrypts a Message
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsqop encrypt\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR] [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-\-as\fR] [\fB\-\-with\-password\fR] [\fB\-\-sign\-with\fR] [\fB\-\-with\-key\-password\fR] [\fB\-\-session\-key\-out\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fICERTS\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Encrypts a Message
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR
Don\*(Aqt ASCII\-armor output
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<PROFILE>\fR
Select the profile to use for encryption
.TP
\fB\-\-as\fR \fI<AS>\fR [default: binary]
Encrypt binary data or UTF\-8 text
.TP
\fB\-\-with\-password\fR \fI<WITH_PASSWORD>\fR
Encrypt with passwords
.TP
\fB\-\-sign\-with\fR \fI<SIGN_WITH>\fR
Keys for signing
.TP
\fB\-\-with\-key\-password\fR \fI<WITH_KEY_PASSWORD>\fR
Try to decrypt the signing KEYS with these passwords
.TP
\fB\-\-session\-key\-out\fR \fI<SESSION_KEY_OUT>\fR
Write the session key here
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fICERTS\fR]
Encrypt for these certs
